---
// FAQ Accordion section addressing outcomes, live classes, and partnership
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-[#FAFCFF] border-t border-[#E8EEF5]" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:nhzwn7">
  <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:iksckk">
    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:iksckj">
      <span class="text-[13px] font-bold text-[#F37424] tracking-wider uppercase block mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk2w">
        FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#243D5D]" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:cg7w3y">Common Questions About Magic Map™ & Training</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion Items -->
    <div class="space-y-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:ikscki">
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all" open>
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk08">Why does Ted Thomas include training with the Magic Map™?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk07">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuur">
          Because handing someone software and leaving them alone leads to confusion and inaction. With Magic Map™, you get live weekly classes and AI-assisted research training where coaches walk you through real county auction lists, teach you how to ask the right research questions, filter out bad properties, and help you find the few deals worth bidding on. Nobody else in the industry offers this combination of data, AI research classes, and live coaching.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopd">Is this a quick-money business or "buy today, profit tomorrow"?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopc">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuuq">
          <strong>No. This is not a quick hit.</strong> Successful students take time to learn the process. Tax-defaulted property is not going anywhere, and this business rewards people who learn the process and keep improving. The Ted Thomas Magic Map™ and live classes provide step-by-step training so you can build long-term, repeatable skills.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopd2">Do I need to be a programmer or technical expert to use this?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopc2">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuuq2">
          Not at all. You don't need any programming skills or technical background. In our live classes and AI sessions, we show you practical, plain-English steps: how to upload county lists, ask the right research questions, review property data, check market values, and spot warning signs before placing a bid.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopb">Why does the offer include 500 Property Reports?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xopa">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuup">
          You are not getting 500 reports so you can drown in homework. You get 500 reports so you have the research capacity to evaluate entire county auctions without running into paywalls or credit limits. In our classes, we teach you how to use this capacity to quickly eliminate the 95% of junk parcels and isolate the top properties.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xop9">Who is Tax Sale Resources and what is their relationship with Ted Thomas?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:u7xop8">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuuo">
          Tax Sale Resources is a trusted research partner of Ted Thomas. Ted believes in bringing in top-tier specialized experts to handle nationwide data aggregation, mapping, and property records, while Ted Thomas and his team provide the education, strategy, and live coaching on how to use that data profitably.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk2t">Do you have a way to filter the list of parcels going to sale?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk2s">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:iksckg">
          Yes. On our interactive property search map, you can filter by property type (single family, vacant land, commercial), opening bid amount, assessed value, parcel size, and risk criteria to quickly isolate parcels that meet Ted's investment criteria.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk24">Do you populate the over the counter (OTC) lists on your platform?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk23">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuux">
          Yes, Over the Counter lists are collected and available to download directly within the application, updated on a monthly basis so you can buy properties directly from counties without bidding at an auction.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk15">Which auctions are covered in the platform?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk14">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuuq">
          All upcoming auctions for tax liens, tax deeds, and redeemable tax deeds across all 50 states are tracked and updated continuously in the platform.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] shadow-2xs overflow-hidden transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-[#243D5D] text-[16px] sm:text-[18px]">
          <span data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk0g">How do I cancel my account if I change my mind?</span>
          <span class="text-[#006AAE] text-2xl font-light transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:dfjk0f">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-6 sm:px-6 text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#5A7184] leading-relaxed border-t border-[#F1F5F9] pt-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Faq.astro:9riuuo">
          You can cancel your subscription at any time with one click from within the settings panel of the application. There are no contracts, no penalties, and no hassle.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
